Package: norr
Architecture: linux-any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, adduser
Description: Encrypted L3 tunnel
 Norr carries IP packets between peers over an authenticated, encrypted
 datapath. Peers are identified by X25519 static keys and authenticated with
 the Noise IKpsk2 pattern; traffic is sealed with ChaCha20-Poly1305 and
 protected by an 8192-entry replay window.
 .
 The UDP carrier is the only transport currently selectable. The QUIC and TCP
 carriers are implemented but not yet usable as tunnel transports; see
 /usr/share/doc/norr/known-limitations.md for what is and is not finished.
